  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Mercados de Trabajo II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization Labor Force II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT STPS IN: (I) STRENGTHENING THE SUPPORT POLICIES FOR A MORE EFFICIENT OPERATION OF THE LABOR MARKETS; AND (II) INCREASING THE TECHNICAL AND ECONOMIC SUPPORT TO UNEMPLOYED WORKERS, AS WELL AS THOSE WORKERS IN MICRO, SMALL, AND MEDIUM-SIZE ENTERPRISES WHO REQUIRE IMPROVEMENT IN THEIR COMPETENCY LEVELS IN ORDER TO INCREASE THE PRODUCTIVITY AND COMPETITIVENESS IN THIS TYPE OF ENTERPRISES</narrative>
